            {
              "id": "f95f0f1",
              "scope": "core",
              "text": "On desktop, a restart asked for while the core is still starting, such as after installing the helper, now restarts it, and the core can start again after a start whose local connection setup hung"
            },
            {
              "id": "7a63bb4",
              "scope": "core",
              "text": "On Android, stopping while the core is still starting no longer leaves it running, and a start that failed while sending settings to the core no longer blocks the next start"
